# HealthFlow — Environment Variable Reference
#
# This file documents environment variable names required by HealthFlow.
# It contains placeholder names ONLY. No real credentials or secrets are stored here.
# Copy this file to .env (which is git-ignored) and supply actual values
# in the appropriate phase when application implementation is authorized.
#
# Actual variable values and required variables will be defined in the applicable
# phase specification before implementation begins.

# --- Application ---
# APP_ENV=
# LOG_LEVEL=

# --- Database ---
# DATABASE_URL=

# --- AWS / Bedrock ---
# AWS_REGION=
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# BEDROCK_MODEL_ID=

# --- Security ---
# SECRET_KEY=
